      <scope classrefs="object" doc="array(typecode [, initializer]) -&gt; array&#10;Return a new array whose items are restricted by typecode, and initialized from the optional initializer value, which must be a list, string. or iterable over elements of the appropriate type.  Arrays represent basic values and behave very much like lists, except the type of objects stored in them is constrained.  Methods:  append() -- append a new item to the end of the array" ilk="class" name="array">
