      <scope classrefs="DecimalException" doc="An invalid operation was performed.&#10;Various bad things cause this:  Something creates a signaling NaN -INF + INF 0 * (+-)INF (+-)INF / (+-)INF x % 0 (+-)INF % x x._rescale( non-integer ) sqrt(-x) , x &gt; 0" ilk="class" line="196" lineend="223" name="InvalidOperation">
