    <scope doc="Tool for measuring execution time of small code snippets.&#10;This module avoids a number of common traps for measuring execution times.  See also Tim Peters' introduction to the Algorithms chapter in the Python Cookbook, published by O'Reilly.  Library usage: see the Timer class.  Command line usage: python timeit.py [-n N] [-r N] [-s S] [-t] [-c] [-h] [--] [statement]  Options:" ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="timeit">
