    <scope doc="Conversion functions between RGB and other color systems.&#10;This modules provides two functions for each color system ABC:  rgb_to_abc(r, g, b) --&gt; a, b, c abc_to_rgb(a, b, c) --&gt; r, g, b  All inputs and outputs are triples of floats in the range [0.0...1.0] (with the exception of I and Q, which covers a slightly larger range). Inputs outside the valid range may cause exceptions or invalid outputs.  Supported color systems:" ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="colorsys">
