    <scope doc="This module provides an interface to the Posix calls for tty I/O control.&#10;For a complete description of these calls, see the Posix or Unix manual pages. It is only available for those Unix versions that support Posix termios style tty I/O control.  All functions in this module take a file descriptor fd as their first argument. This can be an integer file descriptor, such as returned by sys.stdin.fileno(), or a file object, such as sys.stdin itself." ilk="blob" lang="Python" name="termios">
